<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/sbc-logo.png"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles-thbjq83o.css" data-precedence="default"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lato:wght@400;500;700;900&amp;display=swap" data-precedence="default"/><title>Management Consultant in Ahmedabad: Hiring Checklist | SBC</title><meta name="author" content="Sagar Burse Consulting"/><meta name="description" content="Hiring a management consultant in Ahmedabad? Check credentials, fees, case studies and red flags first — a 10-point checklist from SBC, plus a free audit."/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"/><meta property="og:title" content="Management Consultant in Ahmedabad: Hiring Checklist | SBC"/><meta property="og:description" content="Hiring a management consultant in Ahmedabad? Check credentials, fees, case studies and red flags first — a 10-point checklist from SBC, plus a free audit."/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://sbcgroup.in/blog/management-consultant-hiring-checklist-ahmedabad"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://sbcgroup.in/sbc-logo.png"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC)"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Management Consultant in Ahmedabad: Hiring Checklist | SBC"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Hiring a management consultant in Ahmedabad? Check credentials, fees, case studies and red flags first — a 10-point checklist from SBC, plus a free audit."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://sbcgroup.in/sbc-logo.png"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://sbcgroup.in/blog/management-consultant-hiring-checklist-ahmedabad"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/index-LO5pA8ed.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/jsx-runtime-Cltr0gcK.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/link-DgkiFbQO.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/useStore-D-4ReuTk.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/matchContext-lkZ4crva.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/blog-BZHF4mtl.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/blog.management-consultant-hiring-checklist-ahmedabad-CV7bu_CK.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/JsonLd-DIvX5iFW.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/Breadcrumbs-Db4zZA7h.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/CTABand-CowMy-gg.js"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png"/><noscript><style>.reveal{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}.hero-graphic-in>*{opacity:1!important}</style></noscript></head><body><!--$--><div class="min-h-screen bg-paper"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"Management Consultant Hiring Checklist: What to Check Before You Hire in Ahmedabad","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sagar Burse","jobTitle":"Founder & Principal Consultant","url":"https://sbcgroup.in/founder","image":"https://sbcgroup.in/images/founder/sagar-burse-author.webp","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsagarburse/"]},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Sagar Burse Consulting","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://sbcgroup.in/sbc-logo.png"}},"datePublished":"2026-09-23","dateModified":"2026-09-23","description":"Hiring a management consultant in Ahmedabad? Check credentials, fees, case studies and red flags first — a 10-point checklist from SBC, plus a free audit.","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://sbcgroup.in/blog/management-consultant-hiring-checklist-ahmedabad"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I look for in a management consultant in Ahmedabad?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Look for real credentials, a documented method, published case studies with numbers, clarity on who works on your account, and a low-risk first step such as a free audit. See the full 10-point checklist above for all ten criteria."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a good management consultant hiring checklist?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"At minimum, check credentials and experience, a documented method, real case studies, who does the work, implementation support, transparent fees, references, sector experience, a low-risk first step, and a written scope."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much do management consultants in Ahmedabad charge?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Fees vary by scope, so most firms, including SBC, don't publish a fixed price list. Ask what's included, how the fee is structured (project, retainer, or outcome-linked), and whether the first step is free. SBC's first step, a 45-minute business systems audit, has no fee."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What questions should I ask a management consultant before hiring them?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ask to see a case study with real numbers, who specifically will work on your account, what happens after the report is delivered, what's included in the fee, and whether you can start with a smaller engagement first."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I evaluate a management consultant's case studies?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Check that the case study names the industry, states the starting problem specifically, and reports results as a number with a timeframe — for example, \"on-time delivery improved from 61% to 84% in 90 days\" rather than a vague claim."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are red flags when hiring a management consultant?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Case studies with no real numbers, an inability to describe their method step by step, pressure to sign a long retainer before any diagnostic, and no written scope or way to measure success."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I hire a consulting firm or an individual consultant in Ahmedabad?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Either can work — the deciding factor is not firm size but whether senior, experienced people will actually work on your account and stay through implementation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is SBC different from other management consultants in Ahmedabad?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SBC is implementation-led — we stay with your team through execution, not just deliver a report — using a documented six-phase method (GAP360™) and a free 45-minute audit as the first step."}}]}</script><header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-ink-tint bg-paper/95 backdrop-blur"><div class="shell flex h-20 items-center justify-between gap-6 lg:h-28"><a href="/" class="flex min-w-0 shrink-0 items-center"><img src="/sbc-logo.png" alt="Sagar Burse Consulting SBC logo" width="96" height="96" class="size-14 shrink-0 rounded-full sm:size-16 lg:size-24"/></a><nav aria-label="Main" class="hidden items-center gap-2 lg:flex"><div class="relative"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">About Us<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Our Expertise<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><a href="/blog" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Blog</a><a href="/case-studies" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Case Studies</a><a href="/resources" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">SBC Knowledge</a><a href="/contact" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Contact</a><a href="/book-free-audit" class="ml-2 bg-gold px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Free Audit</a></nav><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation" class="rounded p-2 text-ink lg:hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="bg-ink"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://sbcgroup.in/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Blog","item":"https://sbcgroup.in/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Management Consultant Hiring Checklist"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="shell py-3 text-paper/70 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a href="/blog" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Blog</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="font-medium text-paper" aria-current="page">Management Consultant Hiring Checklist</span></li></ol></nav></div><main><section class="bg-ink py-14"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[oklch(0.82_0.11_92.89)]">Consulting Advice</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[2.5rem]">Management Consultant Hiring Checklist: What to Check Before You Hire in Ahmedabad</h1><p class="mt-3 text-[12px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-paper/70">Dr. Sagar Burse · 23 September 2026</p></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="space-y-5 md:col-span-2"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ahmedabad has no shortage of people who call themselves a management consultant — independent advisors, boutique firms, larger consultancies. What&#x27;s hard to see from a first meeting is which one will actually stay through implementation, and which one will hand over a report and disappear. That gap only shows up three months later, when nothing has actually changed.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Hiring the wrong management consultant in Ahmedabad doesn&#x27;t just cost fees. It costs the months spent waiting for results, and it can leave your team more skeptical the next time someone tries to fix things properly. A short checklist before you sign — five minutes of due diligence — is the cheapest insurance available.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">This is a practical, hire-ready checklist for choosing a management consultant. For a broader comparison of consulting firms in Ahmedabad, start with our guide to<!-- --> <a href="/consulting-firms-in-ahmedabad" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">management consulting firms in Ahmedabad</a>; this post picks up from there and focuses on what to check before you actually hire.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="why-checklist" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Why a Checklist Before You Hire a Management Consultant in Ahmedabad</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Most owners hire a consultant after a referral or a single sales call, without checking the signals that actually predict whether an engagement will work. The cost of getting this wrong isn&#x27;t only the fee — it&#x27;s the SOPs nobody adopts, the report that sits in a drawer, and the months you can&#x27;t get back.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Comparing management consultants in Ahmedabad on substance, not just a pitch, takes ten minutes with the checklist below.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="checklist" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">The Management Consultant Hiring Checklist: 10 Points to Check Before You Hire</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Go through these ten points with any management consultant or consulting firm you&#x27;re evaluating in Ahmedabad — including us.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ol class="space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">1<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Real credentials and relevant experience.</span> <!-- -->Ask for formal qualifications and years of hands-on consulting, not just a job title. A consultant with genuine sector experience is worth more than a generic strategy background.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">2<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">A documented method, not instinct.</span> <!-- -->A consultant who can walk you through their process step by step has done this before. A vague answer (&quot;we assess and then advise&quot;) signals an improvised engagement.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">3<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Case studies with real numbers.</span> <!-- -->&quot;We transformed their business&quot; means nothing without a metric attached — on-time delivery, attrition, cost savings, turnaround time. More on this below.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">4<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Who will actually work on your account.</span> <!-- -->Many firms sell with a senior partner and staff the work with juniors. Ask directly who runs the diagnostic, who designs the fix, and who is in the room during implementation.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">5<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Implementation support, not just a report.</span> <!-- -->A report you have to implement yourself is advice, not consulting. Ask what happens after the recommendations are delivered, and for how long.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">6<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">A clear fee structure.</span> <!-- -->Understand what&#x27;s included, what&#x27;s billed separately, and whether the fee is project-based, retainer, or outcome-linked. More on this below.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">7<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">References you can actually call.</span> <!-- -->A consultant confident in their work will connect you with a past client, not just show you a quote.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">8<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Relevant sector and regulatory depth.</span> <!-- -->A manufacturer, a university and a government body each need different expertise — ask about direct experience with your sector and any regulators involved.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">9<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">A low-risk first step.</span> <!-- -->Prefer a consultant who lets you test the fit through a paid or free diagnostic, over one asking for a long commitment upfront.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-display font-semibold text-gold-deep">10<!-- -->.</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-ink">Scope and outcomes in writing.</span> <!-- -->Get deliverables, timeline and how success will be measured in writing before you sign — not a verbal understanding from the sales call.</span></li></ol></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="questions" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">How to Evaluate a Management Consultant: Questions to Ask Before You Hire</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Bring these questions to your first call. How a consultant answers tells you more than their pitch deck.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>“<!-- -->Can you show me a case study with before-and-after numbers, not just a testimonial?<!-- -->”</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>“<!-- -->Who specifically will work on my account — will it be you, or will it be handed off?<!-- -->”</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>“<!-- -->What happens after the report is delivered? Do you stay for implementation?<!-- -->”</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>“<!-- -->What exactly is included in your fee, and what would be billed separately?<!-- -->”</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>“<!-- -->Can we start with a smaller, lower-risk engagement before a long retainer?<!-- -->”</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>“<!-- -->What&#x27;s your experience in my industry, and with the regulators that apply to it?<!-- -->”</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>“<!-- -->How will we both know if this engagement worked?<!-- -->”</span></li></ul></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">If a consultant can&#x27;t answer two or more of these directly, that&#x27;s reason enough to keep looking.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="fees" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Understanding Management Consulting Fees in Ahmedabad</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Management consulting fees vary widely because scope varies widely — a 45-minute diagnostic costs nothing like a six-month organisation redesign. Most established firms, including SBC, don&#x27;t publish a fixed price list for exactly this reason: the honest answer is “it depends on what you need,” not a number on a website.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Before you pay anything, get clarity on whether the fee is project-based, a monthly retainer, or tied to outcomes; what&#x27;s included versus billed as extras; and what the very first, lowest-commitment step costs. SBC&#x27;s first step is a<!-- --> <a href="/book-free-audit" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">free 45-minute business systems audit</a> <!-- -->— no fee, no commitment — before any scoped engagement is discussed.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="case-studies" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">What to Look For in Management Consultant Case Studies</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Case studies are the fastest way to separate a consultant with a real track record from one with a good pitch. A real case study names the client&#x27;s industry, states the starting problem in specific terms, and reports the result as a number with a timeframe — not an adjective.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Look for the difference between “we improved their operations” and “on-time delivery improved from 61% to 84% in 90 days.” SBC publishes its engagements this way — see the<!-- --> <a href="/case-studies" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">full case studies</a>, including a<!-- --> <a href="/case-studies/rubber-plastics-manufacturer" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">rubber and plastics manufacturer</a> <!-- -->where wastage fell 18%, and a<!-- --> <a href="/case-studies/trading-distribution-business" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">trading and distribution business</a> <!-- -->where attrition fell from 34% to 18%. If a consultant can&#x27;t show you this level of specificity, ask why.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="red-flags" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Red Flags: When to Walk Away From a Management Consultant</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>No case study includes a real number — only testimonials and adjectives.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>They can&#x27;t describe their method step by step when asked directly.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>They push for a long retainer before any diagnostic or scoped first step.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>The senior person who pitched you disappears once the contract is signed.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>There&#x27;s no written scope, timeline or way to measure success by the end of the first call.</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>High-pressure tactics — urgency, same-day discounts, no time to check references.</li></ul></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Any one of these is worth a pause. Two or more, and it&#x27;s worth walking away.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="sbc" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">How SBC Measures Up Against This Checklist</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">This checklist comes from the same criteria we use to describe<!-- --> <a href="/consulting-firms-in-ahmedabad#how-to-choose" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">how to choose a management consultant</a> <!-- -->in our main guide, so it&#x27;s fair to hold us to it too: a documented method (the six-phase<!-- --> <a href="/gap360" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">GAP360™</a> <!-- -->framework), published case studies with real numbers, founder-level involvement in every engagement, and a genuinely free first step.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><a href="/book-free-audit" class="inline-flex items-center text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Book your free business systems audit →</a></div><aside aria-labelledby="author-bio-heading" class="!mt-12 border-t border-ink-tint pt-8"><h2 id="author-bio-heading" class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">About the Author</h2><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-5 border border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start"><img src="/images/founder/sagar-burse-author.webp" alt="Sagar Burse, PhD, Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting" width="112" height="112" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-square shrink-0 rounded-full border-2 border-gold object-cover"/><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Sagar Burse, PhD</p><p class="mt-1 font-display text-[15px] italic text-ink-soft">Founder &amp; Principal Consultant, Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC)</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Sagar Burse, PhD is the Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC), headquartered in Ahmedabad, Gujarat. With 8+ years of experience across business consulting, institutional setup, skill development, and regulatory compliance, he brings rare multi-domain depth to every engagement.</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Through SBC, he advises businesses using the GAP360™ methodology — staying with clients from diagnosis to implementation until measurable results are achieved.</p><p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">PhD (Management), GLS University · MBA (Marketing), Gujarat University · UGC-NET and GSET qualified</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a rel="author" href="/founder" class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View Full Profile →</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsagarburse/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">LinkedIn →</a></div></div></div></aside><div class="!mt-10"><a class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold active" href="/blog" data-status="active" aria-current="page">← All Articles</a></div></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal h-fit bg-ink-wash p-6 md:sticky md:top-24"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">In This Article</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li><a href="#why-checklist" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Why a checklist matters</a></li><li><a href="#checklist" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>The 10-point checklist</a></li><li><a href="#questions" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Questions to ask before hiring</a></li><li><a href="#fees" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Understanding consulting fees</a></li><li><a href="#case-studies" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>What to look for in case studies</a></li><li><a href="#red-flags" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Red flags to walk away from</a></li><li><a href="#sbc" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>How SBC measures up</a></li><li><a href="#faq" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>FAQ</a></li></ul><a href="/book-free-audit" class="mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-ink px-3 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-charcoal">Book Free Audit</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><style>.faq-item summary{list-style:none}.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq-item .faq-chev{transition:transform .2s}.faq-item[open] .faq-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}</style><div data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Tap a question to see the answer.</p></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-4"><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What should I look for in a management consultant in Ahmedabad?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Look for real credentials, a documented method, published case studies with numbers, clarity on who works on your account, and a low-risk first step such as a free audit. See the full 10-point checklist above for all ten criteria.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What is a good management consultant hiring checklist?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">At minimum, check credentials and experience, a documented method, real case studies, who does the work, implementation support, transparent fees, references, sector experience, a low-risk first step, and a written scope.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How much do management consultants in Ahmedabad charge?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Fees vary by scope, so most firms, including SBC, don&#x27;t publish a fixed price list. Ask what&#x27;s included, how the fee is structured (project, retainer, or outcome-linked), and whether the first step is free. SBC&#x27;s first step, a 45-minute business systems audit, has no fee.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What questions should I ask a management consultant before hiring them?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Ask to see a case study with real numbers, who specifically will work on your account, what happens after the report is delivered, what&#x27;s included in the fee, and whether you can start with a smaller engagement first.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How do I evaluate a management consultant&#x27;s case studies?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Check that the case study names the industry, states the starting problem specifically, and reports results as a number with a timeframe — for example, &quot;on-time delivery improved from 61% to 84% in 90 days&quot; rather than a vague claim.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What are red flags when hiring a management consultant?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Case studies with no real numbers, an inability to describe their method step by step, pressure to sign a long retainer before any diagnostic, and no written scope or way to measure success.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Should I hire a consulting firm or an individual consultant in Ahmedabad?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Either can work — the deciding factor is not firm size but whether senior, experienced people will actually work on your account and stay through implementation.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How is SBC different from other management consultants in Ahmedabad?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC is implementation-led — we stay with your team through execution, not just deliver a report — using a documented six-phase method (GAP360™) and a free 45-minute audit as the first step.</p></div></details></div></div></section><section id="book" aria-labelledby="cta-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 id="cta-heading" class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.75rem]">Start With a Free 45-Minute Business Audit</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">No commitment. No jargon. Just clarity on where your business stands and what needs to change.</p><a href="/book-free-audit" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-8 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Your Free Audit <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></main><footer class="bg-ink text-paper"><div class="shell grid gap-10 py-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,2.5fr)] lg:gap-10"><div><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3"><img src="/sbc-logo.png" alt="Sagar Burse Consulting SBC logo" width="96" height="96" class="size-[96px] shrink-0 rounded-full"/><span class="truncate font-display text-[17px] font-semibold">Sagar Burse Consulting</span></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-paper/90">A multi-division advisory firm contributing to India&#x27;s MSME ecosystem from Ahmedabad, Gujarat.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-8 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-x-6"><nav aria-label="Quick Links" class="min-w-0"><p class="font-display text-[17px] font-bold text-paper">Quick Links</p><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2"><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/about-sbc" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">About SBC</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/gap360" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">GAP360™</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/case-studies" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">Case Studies</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/blog" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">Blog</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/contact" class="text-paper/85 transition-colors hover:text-gold">Contact</a></li><li class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed break-words"><a href="/book-free-au